<title>USA: MVSI Inc Q2 March 31 net increases.</title>
<headline>MVSI Inc Q2 March 31 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>2nd Quarter, March 31:			   1997	  1996</p>
<p> Revenues					 9,789,881   3,038,459</p>
<p> Net income					 608,103     471,792</p>
<p> Average Shares				14,693,778  10,240,000</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share</p>
<p>   (primary)					    .05	   .05</p>
<p>   (fully diluted)				    .05	   .05</p>
<p>6 Months:</p>
<p> Revenues					18,169,814   6,608,601</p>
<p> Net Income				     1,208,231     802,150</p>
<p> Average Shares				14,708,196  10,240,000</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share</p>
<p>   (primary)					    .10	   .08</p>
<p>   (fully diluted)				    .10	   .08</p>
<p>NOTE:  Average shares outstanding includes the dilutive effect of approximately 6.1 million warrants.</p>
<p>Earnings per share for the second quarter of 1997 were $.06 before considering the dilutive effect of warrants outstanding and $.05 on a diluted basis.</p>
<p>Earnings per share for the first half of 1997 were $0.11 before considering the dilutive effect of warrants outstanding and $0.10 on a diluted basis.</p>
